    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\sigma\\approx1.44$.",
      "worked": "The probabilities sum to 1:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a+b+0.17+0.2+0.3&=1\\\\a+b&=0.33.\\end{aligned}$$\nUsing $E(X)=3.32$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a+2b+3(0.17)+4(0.2)+5(0.3)&=3.32\\\\a+2b&=0.51\\\\b&=0.51-0.33\\\\b&=0.18\\\\a&=0.33-0.18\\\\a&=0.15.\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}E(X^2)&=1^2(0.15)+2^2(0.18)+3^2(0.17)+4^2(0.2)+5^2(0.3)\\\\E(X^2)&=13.1\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=E(X^2)-\\mu^2\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=13.1-3.32^2\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=2.0776\\\\\\sigma&=\\sqrt{2.0776}\\\\\\sigma&\\approx1.44.\\end{aligned}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
